3. Zephyr RTOS — Zephyr Project contributors — Apache-2.0
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

   https://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr

   drivers/display/display_st7789v.c and .h are Zephyr's driver for that controller,
   modified to add display orientation support. Upstream Zephyr returns -ENOTSUP
   for any orientation other than NORMAL, which cannot drive this panel: it is a
   240x280 portrait module used in landscape.

   The modification originates with carrefinho/prospector-zmk-module (MIT) and is
   redistributed here under Apache-2.0, the licence of the file it modifies, with
   the notice of modification Apache-2.0 section 4(b) requires carried at the top
   of the file itself.

   drivers/display/CMakeLists.txt, which shadows Zephyr's copy with the modified
   one, is carrefinho's own file and is MIT — see section 1.

   Orientation support for this controller is not specific to this hardware and
   belongs upstream in Zephyr. Should it land there, these files go away.

