4. Fonts
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

   Generated font sources under src/fonts/ are produced from openly licensed
   typefaces. Each family ships its licence alongside the generated C, and
   scripts/ holds the generators, which are also where the glyph sets are
   declared.

   Nothing here vendors a whole typeface. The generators download the TTF and
   bake only the glyphs actually drawn on screen, so what is redistributed is a
   bitmap subset of an openly licensed face, in the low single-digit KB.

   DINish — The DINish Project Authors — SIL Open Font License 1.1

     https://github.com/playbeing/dinish

     The one Latin family on this display. Licence text at
     src/fonts/DINish-OFL.txt.

     This replaces the three families the derived tree used, two of which
     (Foundry Gridnik, FRAC) are commercial and could not be redistributed at
     all. No part of those ships here.
